e by 6 ✓. So Mia can use 3, 6 or 9 bags."]}, {"k": "try", "t": "Digit sum", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m6u10s3t02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Is 7425 divisible by 9?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "Yes – digit sum 18", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "No", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I test for 3, 6 and 9?", "p": ["Step 1: Add the digits (repeat if the sum is big).", "Step 2: Sum divisible by 3 → number divisible by 3.", "Step 3: Sum divisible by 9 → number divisible by 9.", "Step 4: Divisible by 6 → even AND divisible by 3."]}, {"k": "example", "t": "Not by 6", "p": [], "q": "Is 3711 divisible by 6?", "steps": [["odd → not divisible by 2", ""]], "a": "no"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Missing digit", "p": [], "q": "Find a digit for 52_ so it is divisible by 9.", "steps": [["5 + 2 + ? = 9 or 18", ""], ["? = 2", ""]], "a": "522"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Repeated sum", "p": [], "q": "Is 987 654 divisible by 3?", "steps": [["sum 39 → 3 + 9 = 12", ""], ["12 is divisible by 3", ""]], "a": "yes"}, {"k": "example", "t": "All three", "p": [], "q": "Which of 216, 342, 405 are divisible by 6?", "steps": [["216 even, sum 9 ✓", ""], ["342 even, sum 9 ✓", ""], ["405 odd ✗", ""]], "a": "216 and 342"}, {"k": "try", "t": "Six", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m6u10s3t03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Divisible by 6?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "1236", "ok": true, "fb": "Even, sum 12."}, {"t": "1235", "ok": false, "fb": "Odd."}]}}, {"k": "error", "t": "Only checked one condition", "p": ["Find the first wrong line."], "q": "Is 2007 divisible by 6?", "lines": ["digit sum 9 → divisible by 3", "so divisible by 6"], "bad": 1, "why": "It must also be even. 2007 is odd, so it is NOT divisible by 6.", "fix": [["odd → not divisible by 6", ""]], "id": "m6u10s3t04"}, {"k": "mistake", "t": "Testing only for 3 when checking 6", "p": ["Six needs both: even and divisible by 3."]}, {"k": "tip", "t": "Real life", "p": ["Packing items into equal rows, sharing costs and checking calculations use divisibility tests."]}, {"k": "summary", "t": "What to remember", "p": ["÷3: digit sum divisible by 3.", "÷9: digit sum divisible by 9.", "÷6: even and ÷3.", "Every number divisible by 9 is divisible by 3."]}], "video": {"src": null, "offset": 0, "dur": 720, "range": ""}, "stops": [{"id": "10.3-k1", "t": 1, "after": 0, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m6u10s3k01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Before you read on: 3 bags?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "Yes", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "No", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}, {"id": "10.3-k2", "t": 2, "after": 4, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m6u10s3k02", "type": "num", "prompt": "Digit sum of 5172?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 15, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": ""}}, {"id": "10.3-k3", "t": 3, "after": 9, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m6u10s3k03", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Is 5172 divisible by 6?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "Yes", "ok": true, "fb": "Even and sum 15."}, {"t": "No", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}, {"id": "10.3-k4", "t": 4, "after": 14, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m6u10s3k04", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Quick check: 2468 divisible by 3?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "No – sum 20", "ok": true, "fb": ""}, {"t": "Yes", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}}], "captions": [], "chapters": [[0, 300]], "req": [{"id": "m6u10s3r01", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Divisible by 3?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O3", "skill": "Reasoning", "hint": "", "reason": "", "options": [{"t": "471", "ok": true, "fb": "Sum 12."}, {"t": "472", "ok": false, "fb": ""}]}, {"id": "m6u10s3r02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "D